---
title: LLM agent loop
---
stateDiagram-v2
    hide empty description
    state "Waiting for user" as Waiting
    state "Calling the model" as Thinking
    state "Running a tool" as Acting
    state decide <<choice>>

    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Thinking : user message
    Thinking --> decide
    decide --> Acting : tool call
    decide --> Responding : final answer
    Acting --> Thinking : tool result
    Responding --> Waiting : reply sent

    state Acting {
        direction LR
        [*] --> Validate
        Validate --> Execute
        Execute --> [*]
    }

    Thinking : max 20 steps
    Thinking : temperature 0.2
